      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Después de mucho tiempo, el Ojo volvió trayendo a Shu y a Tefnut.",
          "en": "After a long time, the Eye came back, bringing Shu and Tefnut with it."
        },
        {
          "es": "Atum lloró de alegría al verlos.",
          "en": "Atum wept with joy when he saw them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y donde cayeron sus lágrimas, nacieron los primeros seres humanos.",
          "en": "And where his tears fell, the first human beings were born."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso, en egipcio, la palabra lágrimas, remyt, suena casi igual que la palabra personas, remetj.",
          "en": "That is why, in Egyptian, the word for tears, remyt, sounds almost the same as the word for people, remetj."
        }
