      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Atum también era el sol. Al amanecer lo llamaban Ra, y su luz tocaba primero la cima de la colina.",
          "en": "Atum was also the sun. At dawn they called him Ra, and his light touched the top of the mound first."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mucho después, las pirámides y los obeliscos se coronaron con una punta dorada: una copia de aquella primera colina, lo primero que toca el sol cada mañana.",
          "en": "Much later, pyramids and obelisks were crowned with a golden tip: a copy of that first mound, the first thing the sun touches every morning."
        }
